          "errorStackTrace": "   at Verso.Kernels.NuGetPackageResolver.DownloadSinglePackageAsync(String packageId, String version, Int32 resolution, CancellationToken ct) in /home/runner/work/Verso/Verso/src/Verso/Kernels/NuGetPackageResolver.cs:line 366\n   at Verso.Kernels.NuGetPackageResolver.ResolveWithDependenciesAsync(String packageId, String version, List`1 allPaths, List`1 resolvedPackages, Int32 resolution, CancellationToken ct) in /home/runner/work/Verso/Verso/src/Verso/Kernels/NuGetPackageResolver.cs:line 277\n   at Verso.Kernels.NuGetPackageResolver.ResolvePackageAsync(String packageId, String version, CancellationToken ct) in /home/runner/work/Verso/Verso/src/Verso/Kernels/NuGetPackageResolver.cs:line 205\n   at Verso.Kernels.CSharpKernel.ProcessNuGetReferencesAsync(String code, IExecutionContext context, CancellationToken ct) in /home/runner/work/Verso/Verso/src/Verso/Kernels/CSharpKernel.cs:line 463\n   at Verso.Kernels.CSharpKernel.ExecuteAsync(String code, IExecutionContext context) in /home/runner/work/Verso/Verso/src/Verso/Kernels/CSharpKernel.cs:line 148"
        }
      ]
